# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Takda is entirely client-routed, so paths like /tickets/12 or /j/pasig/1 do
# not exist as files on disk. Without this rule, refreshing the page on any of
# them — or opening a shared link, or scanning a QR code — returns a 404
# instead of the app. The 200 rewrite serves index.html and lets the router
# resolve the path.
#
# The API is not affected: it lives on a separate origin, and /api/* never
# reaches this host.
/* /index.html 200
